  - type: 0
    text: 'Chapter 4 - Throne of the Eclipse: The Slayer Sovereign stands flanked by
      his Royal Guard Paladin and Shadow Flanker Assassin. His passive — The Berserker
      — grants 1-Instant Hot Blooded lifesteal whenever he takes damage, and converts
      every 2 Anger stacks into x2 Fury!'
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 0
    text: 'Tactical Counter: Snipe from range or use Warrior''s Push! so his 1-Instant
      Hot Blooded expires without hitting anyone, use Paladin''s Iron Body to cap
      his Fury cleave to 1 damage, and chain x2 Momentum, Piercing Shot, and Triage!
      to burst him down!'
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
